humanizer-zh is a Chinese-language adaptation inspired by:

  blader/humanizer v2.9.1
  https://github.com/blader/humanizer

The upstream project was created by Siqi Chen and released under the
MIT License. Its original copyright notice is preserved in LICENSE.

This adaptation keeps the upstream principles of factual preservation,
voice calibration, and false-positive protection, while redesigning the
pattern catalog and examples for Chinese writing and Chinese content
platforms.
